                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 109.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-28"><hi rendition="#italic">March 28,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Li Hung Chang’s speedy recovery anticipated. Early resumption of negotiations
                    probable.</p>
